Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.86,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.60,0:01:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.82,0:01:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.44,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way.\NThe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go where we all wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The hate within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.72,0:01:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.62,0:02:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,King has just been defeated. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've defeated the Toby Robo\Nand the lead performers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.34,0:02:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting quite
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,serious but
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:02:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not over
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,there are still two\Nmonsters out there who can
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,stop the Straw Hats it\Nwould take a miracle to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeat but they've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.62,0:03:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,this far the struggle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle between Luffy and\NKaido grows in intensity, however,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,the battle may have an\Nunexpected consequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaido is defeated, his\Nflame clouds will disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This will cause Onigashima to crash,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and the explosives in its basement\Nwill destroy the entire capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the tens of thousands\Nof helpless citizens
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,enjoying the Fire Festival\Nwill be incinerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.18,0:03:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not touching the flower capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back where you belong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To make matters worse, Kanjuro\Ncrafted a massive flame monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.74,0:04:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This manifestation of the Kurozumi\NClan's grudge heads toward
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the castle basements threatening\Nto detonate its entire arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless Yamato can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That fire monster will\Nshow up any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And Roki's blocking the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to\Nget in a fight and grab
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,the key from him and\Npull that massive lever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you cover me, Fuga?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga! Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:04:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.18,0:05:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep Rookie busy for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.22,0:05:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga! Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bodies back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's a relief, but how\Nthe hell does that even work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get both of you\Nto chop her right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.88,0:05:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We got enough problems to deal with!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like my skull bomb grass?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.15,0:05:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's got a bounty of 200 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess this is our lucky day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.32,0:05:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so dead! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If the bad guys don't get\Nme, then the fire will!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go, Sir Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You must save Kiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Master Keen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll leave you both and\Nget out of here on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And why did I even bother coming here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You stupid suicidal samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chipping with honor is still dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sacrifice yourself\Nto take responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that's your culture,\Nbut I don't like it one bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll survive crawling with\Nsnot dripping out of my nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what it takes, it's worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.66,0:06:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If I die with dignity, then\Nwho'd be here to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, sir Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:06:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just holding on the rain\Nshouldn't be enough for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.42,0:07:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to him, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is Izo doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.30,0:07:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we piss off Whitebeard's\Nold crew somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.52,0:07:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an ex-captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not just him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco was here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you, whoever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Esau.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost again. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:07:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll open your walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We can catch up as much as we want\Nlater once our country is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,As your brother, I won't\Nallow you to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.10,0:08:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you out of here\Nno matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.66,0:08:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you truly believe in Straw\NHat Luffy, then you must survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.16,0:08:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank God, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.45,0:09:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the Sniper King!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of those two! You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.54,0:09:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready, Hamlet? Of\Ncourse! Let's go! And away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to depart on a new journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.18,0:09:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No one passes through! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.18,0:09:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You cut fire first!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.02,0:09:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've won!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now undo the paralysis, Jutsu! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you undo yours first?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.26,0:10:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stubborn to the bitter end!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But your Jutsu will be undone\Nonce you burn to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the fires Lord Odin faced!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is but a summer breeze in comparison!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki is alive and the fools\Non this island will soon be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's literally music to my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.02,0:10:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's taking you so long, Fukurokuju?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here\Nbefore this place explodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, is anything the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.64,0:10:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, just thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, while we're here, why\Nnot play that song for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:10:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard it in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.76,0:10:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.32,0:11:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They got drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.56,0:11:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,let's fuck it in b!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We got no reason to fight those guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.90,0:11:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough luck, Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a nuisance and\Na waste of our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're quite strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems Apu ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have Nico Robin in custody yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.42,0:11:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We were interrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.82,0:11:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All the lead performers were defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.42,0:12:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The worst generation is still\Nfighting an uphill battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.32,0:12:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but if they manage to pull this off,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be quite the story indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.56,0:12:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be a massive upset\Nin the balance of power,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,one that would fan the flames of every
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,little fire we're trying\Nto put out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens at the end of this battle\Nwill set the course for our next age.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's certainly true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.64,0:12:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is mankind even capable of more than this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Try that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosarki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, GumGum!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hear GumGum one more time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.54,0:14:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Better get used to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.04,0:14:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Rockside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.58,0:15:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.60,0:15:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One more round!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you had enough already?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,U.A.R.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We get to drink one day a year!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna catch it up today!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me have my fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.26,0:15:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's back to suffering after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Arachis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.92,0:15:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you cut it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Public officials could\Nbe watching us right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're setting up the skyships.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The festival's about to wrap up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.50,0:16:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at all the lanterns!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Write down a wish to your ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll see it up in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know just what to wish for!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.64,0:16:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.55,0:16:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and write one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know why they call them sky ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they go all the way to heaven beyond\Nthe sky, where our lost loved ones are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think Daddy's\Ngonna read my wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.78,0:16:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he'll be happy to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you boozing it up right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.04,0:17:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the fire festival in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We were supposed to have a party on\NOnigashima too until you screwed that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you want some or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have a care in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you tell me you're drunk already?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.70,0:17:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a little sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.22,0:17:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so mean to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked so hard on this\Nparty and you ruined it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're drunk off your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with letting loose a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you supposed\Nto fight me like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.40,0:18:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not use this as an excuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make myself weak\Nand all. Take a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.36,0:18:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm showing you that I accept you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.02,0:18:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.70,0:18:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Drunken Dragon Blah Blah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.46,0:19:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really feeling it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I acknowledge your strength, Strahd.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the first person who's been able\Nto go toe-to-toe with me in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wiping hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.68,0:19:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.46,0:20:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this place. What\Na mess. Everything's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,ruined. I've been having fun going
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wild but now my castle's all screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,look at me I can't even save my own home
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I even do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.48,0:20:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.62,0:20:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta start from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It took five whole years to\Nbuild this place, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.44,0:20:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That hit really hurt! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.40,0:20:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you just pretending to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Be drunk or what? I started
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,my own business sold\Nweapons all over the place
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.88,0:21:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I even made the world's\Nstrongest army. With smile
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,fruits i did my best but\Nit still wasn't good enough
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.12,0:21:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a stupid mistake i\Nlet my guard down not this time
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is the sign I\Nshould just call it quits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.98,0:21:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is rich and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of candy line!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Twister Demolition Brass!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He is all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I'm done! I'm done! Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.12,0:21:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.56,0:21:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I've done takes a crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.16,0:22:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to be alone right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.68,0:22:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.56,0:22:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but it's too late for you to cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.24,0:22:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to leave me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.96,0:22:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.46,0:22:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.04,0:22:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mock!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.60,0:22:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you drunk, take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.46,0:23:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.72,0:23:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,His Haki keeps getting stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.42,0:23:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I like getting drunk, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.56,0:23:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying this over me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.12,0:23:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.80,0:23:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.76,0:23:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.08,0:24:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.38,0:24:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Find that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.00,0:24:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock that land!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.96,0:24:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon's land!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.24,0:24:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock that land!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.98,0:24:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.89,0:24:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,that
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.42,0:24:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,land!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.66,0:24:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.52,0:24:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.16,0:24:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.50,0:25:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This year's reverie has\Nbeen a cursed affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.46,0:25:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Seven Warlords of the\NSea program was abolished.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.14,0:25:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation with Alabasta\Nwas most unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.84,0:25:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Revolutionary Army\Ninvaded the Holy Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.22,0:25:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in lamenting it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.00,0:25:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.91,0:25:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of Wano is our\Nmost pressing concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.24,0:25:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle has certainly had more\Ntwists and turns than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.50,0:25:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our best opportunity to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.08,0:25:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.70,0:25:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll catch Nico Robin somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.10,0:25:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,With Kaido and Big Mom there,\Ndeath could come for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.72,0:25:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an excuse to wipe\Nout our inconveniences.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.60,0:25:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We will erase them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.66,0:26:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And most importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.42,0:26:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll erase the existence of that\NDevil Fruit before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.74,0:26:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintain combat readiness\Nuntil further notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.60,0:26:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships remain on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.10,0:26:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.26,0:26:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.02,0:26:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.44,0:26:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a giant shadow. A shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.34,0:26:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.10,0:26:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea, sir. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.20,0:26:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.68,0:26:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.76,0:26:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's unthinkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.26,0:26:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even to those who know the truth,\Nit's hardly more than a legend now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.14,0:27:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It hasn't awakened for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.78,0:27:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we still have cause to fear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.16,0:27:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The world government gave it another name\Nthat is proof that the fruit is a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.60,0:27:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one reason\Nsomeone would do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.48,0:27:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,To hide its name from\Nhistory, it must be erased.
